This test is disabled.
The handling of path separators on windows & linux is problematic.
Under windows, forward & back slashes are acceptable, and the comiler emits back-slashes.
Under linux, only forward slashes are acceptable, and the compiler emits forward-slashes.

Either:
 a) the windows tools must emit only forward-slashes.
 b) the linux tools must accept forward & back slashes - and escape characters!

